      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "For SFO–Bangkok on January 15, 2027, the clearest choice is between reaching Bangkok the evening of January 16 and taking a later departure from San Francisco for a January 17 arrival. Both are economy awards booked as a single award through Aeroplan, at the same quoted points level; the trade-off is schedule, not cabin.",
